## Bashan OS — localization support.
## The 13 shipped languages are listed in docs/I18N.md. Per-language gaps
## (missing LibreOffice UI, missing spellcheck) are recorded there and must
## not be papered over.

# Locale generation
locales

# Input methods, needed for Arabic/Hebrew/Syriac/Persian keyboards and for
# anyone typing a script their keyboard does not have
ibus
ibus-m17n
im-config

# KDE's own translations for the shipped languages
plasma-workspace-data
